WEBVTT

1
00:00:19,290 --> 00:00:20,610
Thank God

2
00:00:21,380 --> 00:00:23,420
This time it was really scary Xiaoxiao

3
00:00:23,580 --> 00:00:24,900
You are ready to go back now

4
00:00:25,260 --> 00:00:26,620
Do you want me to drive and burn you?

5
00:00:26,900 --> 00:00:28,780
I'm afraid it's hard to leave now.

6
00:00:28,980 --> 00:00:30,980
I still have to buy something, Sister Wang

7
00:00:30,980 --> 00:00:34,700
You go back first, then let's go together. I have to buy some too.

8
00:00:34,900 --> 00:00:36,180
I always feel uneasy

9
00:00:36,780 --> 00:00:38,460
I heard there will be heavy rain in the next few days.

10
00:00:38,660 --> 00:00:39,740
All students are on holiday

11
00:00:39,860 --> 00:00:45,410
Maybe our company also has to take a holiday, so let’s go together, Xiaoxiao

12
00:00:45,570 --> 00:00:46,490
Aren't you scared?

13
00:00:46,690 --> 00:00:49,740
It's the first time I've discovered that you're so courageous.

14
00:00:49,980 --> 00:00:51,660
And there’s no point in being afraid, right?

15
00:00:52,940 --> 00:00:54,420
You seem to be from a single parent family

16
00:00:54,860 --> 00:00:56,660
They divorced after I took the college entrance examination

17
00:00:56,860 --> 00:00:57,820
break up peacefully

18
00:00:58,390 --> 00:01:01,030
Live on your own after going to college

19
00:01:02,210 --> 00:01:03,330
living expenses

20
00:01:05,660 --> 00:01:07,580
It takes effort on both sides

21
00:01:07,900 --> 00:01:09,300
I can only work and drop out of school

22
00:01:09,660 --> 00:01:14,280
The one where Mianmian Qiangqiang finished his studies

23
00:01:14,520 --> 00:01:16,080
If you want to eat home-cooked food in the future

24
00:01:16,080 --> 00:01:17,040
You can come to my house

25
00:01:17,440 --> 00:01:19,600
My husband is a cook and can cook well

26
00:01:22,400 --> 00:01:24,960
Brother Liu is working as a chef in a five-star hotel. He is so humble.

27
00:01:25,080 --> 00:01:26,320
Isn't that also a cook?
